@startuml
' What: the structure of a profile (D-31); every realm has one (D-26), the advisor too (D-27).
' Shows: temperament = a distribution over five families, ego = one scalar;
'        each family is one energy with a poison side and a wisdom side.
' Source: brainstorming-base.md, D-31, Appendix A.1 (family verbs).
title Profile = temperament + ego (D-31)
class Profile {
  temperament : share per family
  ego : one scalar
}
class Family {
  poison
  wisdom
}
Profile "1" o-- "5" Family : temperament share
note right of Family
  Confusion <-> Space
  Anger <-> Mirror
  Pride <-> Equality
  Attachment <-> Discernment
  Jealousy <-> Accomplishing
end note
note bottom of Profile : Transformation: ego goes down, temperament stays.\nA proud mind becomes equanimous, not humble.
@enduml
